          "description": "Unshaded right triangle with a vertical left leg, horizontal base, unlabelled hypotenuse and theta at the bottom-right vertex. Ordinary marks use house black.",
          "mathematics": "The side opposite theta has length 1, the adjacent side has length 2, and the right angle is at the bottom-left vertex.",
